<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western Gas raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western Gas raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised the rating on Western Gas Resources Inc to the recommended list from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares gained one to 18-3/8.</p>
</text>
